{"id":"vod_lz_107384","vodId":"107384","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"七龙珠国语","name_cn":"七龙珠国语","date":"1986-01-01","year":"1986","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20250701-1/2a91806187f915d72fa22a549411620c.jpg"},"summary":"很久很久以前，曾流传着这样一个传说：世界各地散落着七颗龙珠，只要集齐这些珠子，就可召唤出神龙，而神龙可以帮助你实现任何一个愿望。                                    \r\n                                　　住在深山中的小悟空本领高强，偶然的机会他随时尚少女布尔玛走出大山，四处寻找传说中的龙珠。期间碰上好色的鬼仙人与乌龙、一碰女人就面红耳赤的乐平、自大的小和尚克林，经历了各种各样的艰险和奇遇，也惹出一连串爆笑的故事。当然还有许多邪恶的家伙为了满足私欲寻找龙珠，与小悟空他们展开了连番激斗……                                    \r\n                                　　根据鸟山明同名漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-07-01 14:33:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":153,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250628/22703_09efc7bf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250628/22704_2010d2e6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250628/22705_83293b4d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250628/22707_559f9260/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250628/22706_ee038e50/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250628/22708_7ab61a06/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250628/22709_ce328d92/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250628/22710_5ab8ad0f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250628/22711_111dcee2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250628/22712_7127eed6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250628/22713_aadf4cfa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250628/22714_93d64468/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250628/22715_762d6888/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/202506